error[E0206]: '@view' needs a pointer, and this is u64
 --> test/std/view_misuse.phi:6:18
  |
6 |     return @view(n, 4)
  |                  ^ not a pointer

error[E0211]: '@view' takes a count, and this is an untyped float
  --> test/std/view_misuse.phi:10:21
   |
10 |     return @view(p, 1.5)
   |                     ^^^ not a count
   |
   = help: a count is a 'u64', the way a view's own '.len' is

